# Browser-Swin2SR generated artifacts. Canonical hashes, metrics, manifests,
# and public Hugging Face revisions are committed, together with scientific
# result JSON and training logs. Rebuildable model payloads, media, raw ingests,
# and Rust/WASM build outputs stay local.
experiments/browser_swin2sr/**/*.onnx
experiments/browser_swin2sr/**/*.safetensors
experiments/browser_swin2sr/**/*.bin
experiments/browser_swin2sr/**/*.gz
experiments/browser_swin2sr/**/*.mp4
experiments/browser_swin2sr/**/*.npz
experiments/browser_swin2sr/**/*.log
experiments/browser_swin2sr/**/runtime-fixture*.json
experiments/browser_swin2sr/runtime/target/
experiments/browser_swin2sr/video_training_data_*/index/*.jsonl

# Archived LLM gate preparation can generate large resumable streams locally.
# The sealed protocols, universes, and source code are the committed record.
